# notcurses-demo-intro.script
# Run the notcurses-demo intro scene only (`-p intro`). The intro
# scene paints the NC logo with Braille + quadrant glyphs + RGB
# color fade + transparency — high tuple yield per second, which
# is ideal for the catalog's de-facto discovery pass.
COMMAND: notcurses-demo -p /usr/share/notcurses i
WAIT: 6000ms
KEY: q
